                "pos": "adv",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "0852deff-3c00-3bb0-8004-f1011d26c089",
                        "entry_id": "458cfd33-eb96-33ad-bf3f-3ced08515aff",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Abbreviation of totally."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "abbreviation",
                            "alt-of",
                            "colloquial",
                            "not-comparable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "cd4b9c53-1d80-492a-9fcc-c022bfe7df1e",
                                "sense_id": "0852deff-3c00-3bb0-8004-f1011d26c089",
                                "text": "“Apparently, I suck at being nonviolent.” “Dude, sucking at something is the first step towards being sort of good at something. You and I are like little baby Billys right now, and we're \"sucking\" on our first bottle of nonviolent milk.” “[sighs] Totes. I'll stop \"pooping my diaper.\"” “Whoa, what?!”"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1d5d5719-cbc3-405d-8b7f-1e5eb66fef41",
                                "sense_id": "0852deff-3c00-3bb0-8004-f1011d26c089",
                                "text": "Omg, diary, mid-year rotto was the best. time. EVER. Whole #squad stayed at Geordie Bay, obvi. All the planning totes paid off - literally so wasted from start to finish."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "fa85e929-68a0-4b1b-8ef9-dc1e1a52a81d",
                                "sense_id": "0852deff-3c00-3bb0-8004-f1011d26c089",
                                "text": "“I don't know how I would have gotten through this without you.” “Oh, the feeling is mutual. I've always schemed and connived alone. But as a duo, it is, as you might say, \"totes ridic!\"” “(gasps) I would say that.”"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "686a934e-8016-4d6a-9204-f92e01f85ef8",
                                "sense_id": "0852deff-3c00-3bb0-8004-f1011d26c089",
                                "text": "“You convinced us, too.” “Yeah, we're totes donating our dividend check next year.”"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
